abstract: >
  Reference implementation of Invariant Statistical Loss (ISL) methods for
  implicit generative models, including multivariate ISL-slicing and Pareto-ISL
  for heavy-tailed distributions. ISL provides a discriminator-free alternative
  to adversarial GAN training and can also be used for stable pretraining before
  adversarial fine-tuning.

