  - invariant statistical loss
  - implicit generative models
  - generative adversarial networks
  - GANs
  - GAN training
  - adversarial training
  - GAN alternatives
  - discriminator-free generative modeling
  - mode collapse
  - training stability
  - heavy-tailed distributions
  - Pareto-ISL
  - random projections
  - sliced divergences
  - generative modeling

